WEBVTT

00:09:27.491 --> 00:09:31.785
then I think we create
a better, healthier, fairer

00:09:31.809 --> 00:09:34.240
and happier society here at home.

00:09:34.264 --> 00:09:36.294
And we play our part in Scotland

00:09:36.318 --> 00:09:40.532
in building a fairer,
happier world as well.

00:09:40.556 --> 00:09:41.945
Thank you very much.

00:09:41.969 --> 00:09:47.531
(Applause)